      ":question/problem": "Let $X$ be a continuous random variable with the following probability density function:\n$f_{X}(x) = {4e^{-4x},\\begin{vmatrix}x > 0 \\\\ 0,\\end{vmatrix}otherwise$\nIf $Y = 2X$, then what is the probability density function of $Y$?"
